fend Support Cardano (ADA) continued to trade between $0.80 and $0.82 on September 4, 2025. This range has held as a strong support zone, with repeated buying activity reinforcing the $0.80 line as an important floor. If ADA slips below this support, the next key level sits at $0.76, a point that was already defended in late August. Meanwhile, the RSI showed neutral readings, suggesting no strong momentum in either direction. Funding rates and open interest remain steady, showing that the market is still active. Traders are now watching the $0.83 to $0.84 level. A breakout above could reset ADA’s short-term path. For now, buyers seem determined to keep it above $0.80. Last Words As SHIB waits for a breakout and ADA protects its $0.80 zone, BlockDAG is moving ahead on its own path, built on delivery rather than speculation. Thousands of physical miners are already active, while millions take part daily through the X1 app, creating powerful momentum from real usage. The price, locked at $0.0013 until October 1, makes its early entry even more attractive ahead of the Singapore Deployment Event. While other projects hold back for confirmation, BlockDAG (BDAG) is proving itself with live results. Often, the strongest clue lies not in what may happen someday but in what is already working right now, and BlockDAG is showing exactly that. Presale: https://purchase.blockdag.network Website: https://blockdag.network Telegram: https://t.me/blockDAGnetworkOfficial Discord: https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu Disclaimer: This is a sponsored press release for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Times Tabloid, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. The post BlockDAG Leads With 19,800 Miners Shipped as SHIB Waits and ADA Holds $0.80 appeared first on Times Tabloid .', 'KEYWORDS': 'Finance', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1758042054, 'UPDATED_ON': None, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 67, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'timestabloid', 'NAME': 'TimesTabloid', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/67/default.png', 'URL': 'https://timestabloid.com/feed/', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1758044643, 'CREATED_ON': 1664381507, 'UPDATED_ON': 1673235440}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 211, 'NAME': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY', 'CATEGORY': 'CRYPTOCURRENCY'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 44, 'NAME': 'SHIB', 'CATEGORY': 'SHIB'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 3, 'NAME': 'ADA', 'CATEGORY': 'ADA'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'TRADING', 'CATEGORY': 'TRADING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 47, 'NAME': 'SPONSORED', 'CATEGORY': 'SPONSORED'}]}, {'TYPE': '121', 'ID': 51831236, 'GUID': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/?p=205147', 'PUBLISHED_ON': 1758042012, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/82/51831236.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'Unlocking Value: Galaxy Digital’s Groundbreaking Tokenized Money Market Fund', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Editorial Team', 'URL': 'https://bitcoinworld.co.in/tokenized-money-market-fund-galaxy/', 'SOURCE_ID': 82, 'BODY': 'BitcoinWorld Unlocking Value: Galaxy Digital’s Groundbreaking Tokenized Money Market Fund The world of finance is constantly evolving, and at its forefront is the exciting convergence of traditional assets with blockchain technology. Imagine a world where your investments are not only secure but also accessible, transparent, and efficient, all thanks to digital innovation. This vision is rapidly becoming a reality, with major players like Galaxy Digital stepping up to redefine the landscape. Recently, news broke that Galaxy Digital is reportedly planning to launch a groundbreaking tokenized money market fund , a move poised to reshape how we think about liquidity and digital assets. This development, cited by CoinDesk from sources familiar with the matter, highlights a significant leap forward for institutional adoption in the crypto space. What Exactly is a Tokenized Money Market Fund? A tokenized money market fund essentially takes the concept of a traditional money market fund – which invests in highly liquid, short-term debt instruments – and wraps it into a digital token on a blockchain. This means that instead of holding paper certificates or entries in a traditional ledger, you hold digital tokens representing your share of the fund. This innovative approach to a tokenized money market fund offers several compelling advantages for investors: Enhanced Accessibility: These funds can be accessed by a wider range of investors, potentially lowering entry barriers compared to traditional investment vehicles. Increased Transparency: Blockchain’s inherent transparency means transactions and fund holdings can be more easily audited and verified, fostering greater trust. Faster Settlement: Digital tokens can be transferred and settled much quicker than traditional assets, reducing friction and increasing efficiency in transactions. Why is Galaxy Digital Pioneering This Innovation Now? Galaxy Digital, a leading diversified financial services and investment management firm in the digital asset sector, is reportedly making a significant stride into this nascent but promising market. While the firm has declined to comment on the specific reports, the potential launch of a tokenized money market fund aligns perfectly with the broader trend of institutional adoption of blockchain technology. The fund is expected to debut on prominent blockchains: Ethereum, Solana, and Stellar. This multi-chain strategy is crucial for several reasons: Ethereum: As the largest and most established smart contract platform, it offers vast liquidity and a robust developer ecosystem. Solana: Known for its high throughput and low transaction costs, making it ideal for scalable financial applications. Stellar: Designed specifically for payments and tokenized assets, offering fast and inexpensive cross-border transactions. By utilizing these diverse networks, Galaxy Digital aims to maximize reach and efficiency for its digital asset offerings. The Transformative Impact of a Tokenized Money Market Fund The introduction of a tokenized money market fund by a reputable firm like Galaxy Digital could have a ripple effect across both traditional finance and the crypto ecosystem. It effectively bridges the gap between these two worlds, offering institutional investors a familiar, low-risk investment vehicle in a digitally native format. This move signifies growing confidence in the security and viability of blockchain for sophisticated financial products. However, the path to widespread adoption isn’t without its hurdles. Regulatory clarity remains a key challenge, as does educating traditional investors about the security and operational benefits of blockchain-based assets. Interoperability between different blockchains and ensuring robust security measures are also paramount for success in this evolving landscape. For individuals and institutions, this could mean new avenues for earning yield on stable assets within the digital economy, reducing reliance on centralized intermediaries, and enhancing financial inclusion. Consider a scenario where a company can instantly move idle cash into a tokenized money market fund on Solana, earning daily yield, and then quickly redeem it for payroll, all within a compliant and transparent framework. Galaxy Digital’s reported venture into the tokenized money market fund space marks a significant milestone in the institutionalization of digital assets. By leveraging the power of blockchain across multiple prominent networks, they are not just launching a product; they are contributing to the foundational infrastructure of a new financial era. This move underscores the growing confidence in blockchain technology to handle sophisticated financial products, promising a future where traditional finance and decentralized innovation coexist and thrive. Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) What is a tokenized money market fund? A tokenized money market fund is a digital representation of a traditional money market fund, where shares are issued as tokens on a blockchain. These tokens represent ownership of highly liquid, short-term debt instruments. Which blockchains will Galaxy Digital’s fund reportedly use? According to reports, Galaxy Digital’s tokenized money market fund is slated to launch on the Ethereum, Solana, and Stellar blockchains. What are the key benefits of investing in a tokenized money market fund? Key benefits include enhanced accessibility, increased transparency through blockchain’s immutable ledger, and faster settlement times compared to traditional funds. Are there any challenges or risks associated with tokenized money market funds? Yes, challenges include evolving regulatory frameworks, the need for investor education on blockchain technology, and ensuring robust security and interoperability across different blockchain networks. How does this differ from a traditional money market fund? The primary difference lies in the underlying technology and asset representation. While traditional funds use conventional ledgers and paper certificates, a tokenized fund uses blockchain technology to represent ownership as digital tokens, enabling greater efficiency and transparency. What are your thoughts on the future of tokenized finance? Share this article on your social media to spark a conversation about Galaxy Digital’s innovative move and the evolving landscape of digital assets! To learn more about the latest tokenized finance trends, explore our article on key developments shaping digital asset adoption in the financial market . This post Unlocking Value: Galaxy Digital’s Groundbreaking Tokenized Money Market Fund first appeared on BitcoinWorld .', 'KEYWORDS': 'Crypto News|ETHE