PUBLISHED_ON': 1758041916, 'PUBLISHED_ON_NS': None, 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/75/51831469.jpeg', 'TITLE': 'More Than 312,000 Holders Trust BlockDAG: Here’s What Makes This Presale Crypto Coin Unstoppable!', 'SUBTITLE': None, 'AUTHORS': 'Elliot Veynor', 'URL': 'https://cryptodaily.co.uk/2025/09/more-than-312000-holders-trust-blockdag-heres-what-makes-this-presale-crypto-coin-unstoppable', 'SOURCE_ID': 75, 'BODY': 'Most crypto projects peak during announcements and stall on delivery. BlockDAG flipped that pattern. Instead of hype cycles, it built momentum with every update, turning early adopters into long-term participants. This isn’t about retail rush or influencer pump; it’s about repeat conviction from real users. From mining apps to real hardware, testnet infrastructure to explorer tools, BlockDAG (BDAG) has added substance, not just features. That’s why over 312,000 holders trust this network entirely, because the community isn’t buying into a promise; they’re opting into a system that works. And as it keeps expanding, so does the number of people saying “yes.” Tech That Shows, Not Tells BlockDAG’s growth wasn’t built on mystery boxes or future whitepapers. It was built on real-time delivery. The X1 mobile mining app brought millions into BDAG mining without the need for expensive rigs or complicated setups. Over 3 million users are actively mining through their phones, and the experience isn’t hypothetical; it’s functional, live, and easy. Then came the X10 hardware miner. Compact, plug-and-play, and capable of generating 200 BDAG/day, the X10 added physical proof to BlockDAG’s credibility. With nearly 20,000 X-series units sold across 130+ countries and a roadmap scaling to 2,000 units per week, the network isn’t waiting on infrastructure; it’s distributing it . The tech rollout didn’t stop at devices. Explorer tools for real-time tracking, account abstraction capabilities, and a fully activated testnet; these aren’t features waiting for “post-launch.” They’re already in use. This forward deployment is exactly why thousands of users double down daily: because every update builds usability, not just optics. A Presale That Acts Like a Mainnet It’s rare for a presale project to offer as much visible traction as BlockDAG. While most early-stage tokens promise features after listings, BlockDAG treats its presale like a foundation layer. Nearly $410 million has already been raised, with $40 million of that in just the past month, a pace that shows people aren’t just buying; they’re buying again. Currently in Batch 30, the presale price stands at $0.03. But BlockDAG’s final flat-rate window allows users to purchase BDAG at just $0.0013 until October 1st, locking in a rare opportunity to buy at 2,900% ROI compared to Batch 1. More than 26.2 billion BDAG coins have already been sold, not because of marketing fluff, but because the system proves its case in public. From the X1 app’s performance to miner shipments and the Awakening Testnet’s rollout, BlockDAG is treating every day like it’s launch day. That intensity is what converts presale participants into daily advocates. Community Grows When Confidence Compounds The easiest way to spot a project’s health is by looking at whether people return. BlockDAG’s community is growing by 1,000+ new holders daily, but what’s more telling is how many stay and scale their involvement. That’s not just fandom. That’s function. From live unboxing videos of the X10 miner to walkthroughs of the X1 app, the community isn’t just active; they’re visible. The hashtag #BlockDAGX10 has become a digital proof trail, with users posting real footage of their miners running at home, in offices, even in small businesses. Community channels are equally alive. With 325,000+ users across social platforms and 1,000+ daily Medium readers, BlockDAG’s growth isn’t confined to wallets; it extends to dialogue, feedback, and public engagement. It’s why the upcoming Singapore Deployment Event, in partnership with Coinstore, is being positioned as a milestone in the movement, not just a PR moment. Conclusion: 312,000 Said Yes Because BlockDAG Doesn’t Stall The numbers didn’t happen by luck. BlockDAG crossed 312,000 holders because every product worked, every rollout landed, and every promise was backed by code, not slides. From mobile apps to real mining hardware , from testnets to global shipping lanes, the project has delivered in a way few presale coins ever do. And now, as the $0.0013 final presale price holds through October 1st, new and returning participants have one last chance to join before the official deployment. This isn’t the beginning of something; it’s the continuation of a system that already works. Holders didn’t just say yes once. They’re saying it again, daily. And that’s the strongest signal of all. Presale: https://purchase.blockdag.network Website: https://blockdag.network Telegram: https://t.me/blockDAGnetworkOfficial Discord: https://discord.gg/Q7BxghMVyu Disclaimer: This is a sponsored article and is for informational purposes only. It does not reflect the views of Crypto Daily, nor is it intended to be used as legal, tax, investment, or financial advice.', 'KEYWORDS': 'More News', 'LANG': 'EN', 'UPVOTES': 0, 'DOWNVOTES': 0, 'SCORE': 0, 'SENTIMENT': 'POSITIVE', 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'CREATED_ON': 1758042402, 'UPDATED_ON': 1758042402, 'SOURCE_DATA': {'TYPE': '120', 'ID': 75, 'SOURCE_KEY': 'cryptodaily', 'NAME': 'Crypto Daily', 'IMAGE_URL': 'https://resources.cryptocompare.com/news/75/default.png', 'URL': 'https://cryptodaily.co.uk/feed', 'LANG': 'EN', 'SOURCE_TYPE': 'RSS', 'LAUNCH_DATE': None, 'SORT_ORDER': 0, 'BENCHMARK_SCORE': 0, 'STATUS': 'ACTIVE', 'LAST_UPDATED_TS': 1758044646, 'CREATED_ON': 1685543991, 'UPDATED_ON': 1685544026}, 'CATEGORY_DATA': [{'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 39, 'NAME': 'MINING', 'CATEGORY': 'MINING'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 41, 'NAME': 'REGULATION', 'CATEGORY': 'REGULATION'}, {'TYPE': '122', 'ID': 50, 'NAME': 'T